      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Morphology playground\n\nEvery cv2.morphologyEx operation applied to the SAME Otsu binary (dark shapes on a light background become white blobs), with one shared structuring element - change its shape/ksize on the 'kernel' node and every tile follows. \n\nWhat to look for: open removes specks smaller than the kernel, close fills pinholes, gradient outlines each blob, top hat keeps what open removed, black hat keeps what close added. "
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
